Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
We need 2 changes before proceeding: add extra variables to the function \
definitions and remove the Exp[x_] from function definitions for every \
function with more than one derivative. there are 4 variables to add: (gmst, \
f,  detectorPosition, detectorTensor), none of which are being derived. So:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.937369355283937*^9, 3.937369381439569*^9}, {
